   "topic": "Cell injury, adaptation, necrosis vs apoptosis",
   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "In experimental ischemia, which finding best marks the transition from REVERSIBLE to IRREVERSIBLE cell injury?",
