   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "A neonate presents with severe congenital lactic acidosis and progressive neurological impairment. Blood shows elevated lactate and pyruvate with a normal lactate-to-pyruvate ratio. The most likely defect is:",
