   "topic": "Asphyxial deaths (hanging, drowning)",
   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "A previously healthy 2-month-old infant who had been co-sleeping with an intoxicated adult is found dead in the bed with no injuries and no natural disease. The classic accidental asphyxial mechanism to be considered is:",
