   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "A young man is found dead alone in a locked room, partially suspended by a ligature that has soft padding beneath it, cross-dressed, surrounded by mirrors and pornographic material, with a self-release mechanism within reach that had failed. The most appropriate conclusion regarding the manner of death is:",
