   "subject": "Forensic Medicine (FMT)",
   "topic": "Death, postmortem changes (rigor/livor/algor)",
   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "E",
   "stem": "According to Bichat's classification, the three modes of death are coma, syncope and asphyxia. Syncope as a mode of death results from primary failure of which system?",
   "options": [
