   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "Which statement most accurately describes the postmortem body-temperature (algor mortis) curve?",
   "options": [
    "It is sigmoid, with an initial plateau during which cooling is minimal before the rapid phase",
    "It is perfectly linear, the body losing exactly one degree Celsius every hour until it reaches ambient temperature",
