   "topic": "Death, postmortem changes (rigor/livor/algor)",
   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "A body left in a freezing environment becomes rigid within a short time. This 'cold stiffening', which disappears on rewarming, is due to what?",
   "options": [
