   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "A patient with long-standing HBsAg positivity has persistently raised ALT and a high serum HBV-DNA, yet HBeAg is negative and anti-HBe is positive. The best explanation for active disease despite a negative HBeAg is:",
