   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "In the conventional serial HIV testing algorithm, a repeatedly reactive ELISA is traditionally confirmed by Western blot. A Western blot is interpreted as POSITIVE when antibodies are detected against which of the following?",
