   "subject": "Ophthalmology",
   "topic": "Glaucoma",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "Latanoprost, a prostaglandin analogue commonly used as first-line therapy in primary open-angle glaucoma, lowers intraocular pressure mainly by:",
