   "subject": "Ophthalmology",
   "topic": "Glaucoma",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "A patient is found to have a thin central corneal thickness of 480 microns. Compared with the true intraocular pressure, Goldmann applanation tonometry in this eye will most likely:",
