   "subject": "Ophthalmology",
   "topic": "Refractive errors",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "For accurate refraction of a 3-year-old child with a suspected accommodative convergent squint and high hypermetropia, the cycloplegic agent of choice is:",
