   "topic": "Refractive errors",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "A 28-year-old with stable −13 D myopia and a thin central cornea of 480 µm wishes to be spectacle-independent. LASIK is inadvisable here because of insufficient residual stromal bed. The most appropriate option is:",
