   "topic": "Acute & chronic inflammation, healing/repair",
   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "E",
   "stem": "The four classic cardinal signs of acute inflammation are rubor, tumor, calor and dolor. The fifth sign, added later by Virchow, is:",
