   "topic": "Acute & chronic inflammation, healing/repair",
   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "A child with partial oculocutaneous albinism, recurrent pyogenic infections, mild bleeding tendency and peripheral neuropathy has neutrophils containing giant cytoplasmic granules on a blood smear. The underlying defect is in:",
