   "topic": "Acute & chronic inflammation, healing/repair",
   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "Regarding eicosanoids derived from arachidonic acid, which pairing of mediator with its predominant vascular and platelet action is CORRECT?",
   "options": [
