   "subject": "Pathology",
   "topic": "Acute & chronic inflammation, healing/repair",
   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "The pathway by which bacterial lipopolysaccharide produces fever culminates in which final mediator acting on the hypothalamic thermoregulatory centre?",
   "options": [
