   "stem": "A second-line antitubercular drug that is structurally related to isoniazid causes marked gastrointestinal intolerance and, with prolonged use, hypothyroidism with goitre as well as hepatotoxicity. Which drug is this?",
   "options": [
    "Para-aminosalicylic acid (PAS)",
    "Capreomycin",
