   "topic": "General & local anaesthetics, opioids",
   "part": "A",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "Propofol infusion syndrome, associated with prolonged high-dose propofol infusion (particularly in critically ill or paediatric patients), is characterised by:",
