   "subject": "PSM (Community Medicine)",
   "topic": "Epidemiology & control: TB, malaria, HIV",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "The secondary attack rate is BEST expressed as the number of exposed persons developing the disease within the range of the incubation period, as a proportion of:",
