   "topic": "Demography, family planning, MCH indicators",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "Which statement correctly distinguishes the Gross Reproduction Rate (GRR) from the Net Reproduction Rate (NRR)?",
   "options": [
    "GRR counts total children (both sexes); NRR counts only sons surviving to adulthood",
