   "topic": "Screening: sensitivity/specificity/PPV",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "A screening test has a sensitivity of 90% and a specificity of 80%. What is its positive likelihood ratio (LR+)?",
   "options": [
