   "topic": "Screening: sensitivity/specificity/PPV",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "For the same 2000-person community (prevalence 10%, sensitivity 90%, specificity 80%), what is the approximate negative predictive value (NPV)?",
