   "subject": "PSM (Community Medicine)",
   "topic": "Screening: sensitivity/specificity/PPV",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "For a continuous screening marker (for example fasting blood glucose used to detect diabetes), LOWERING the diagnostic cutoff value will:",
