   "subject": "PSM (Community Medicine)",
   "topic": "Screening: sensitivity/specificity/PPV",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "Screening detects a condition (for example some indolent prostate cancers) that would never have caused symptoms or death during the person's lifetime. This is best described as:",
