   "id": "Q_GEN_PSYCH_SCHIZO_006",
   "subject": "Psychiatry",
   "topic": "Schizophrenia & psychosis",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "E",
   "stem": "A patient is convinced that television news anchors are talking specifically about him and inserting coded personal messages into their broadcasts, though he does not feel harmed by them. This is an example of:",
