   "subject": "Psychiatry",
   "topic": "Schizophrenia & psychosis",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "A severely depressed 70-year-old woman insists that her bowels have rotted and stopped working, that she has no blood left, and that she is in fact already dead. This delusion is best classified as:",
   "options": [
    "Somatic (hypochondriacal) delusion",
