   "subject": "Psychiatry",
   "topic": "Schizophrenia & psychosis",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "E",
   "stem": "A 22-year-old man has had the full symptom picture of schizophrenia for the past 3 months but not yet 6 months. Assuming symptoms are not due to substances or another medical condition, the correct diagnosis at this point is:",
