   "topic": "Schizophrenia & psychosis",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "A 50-year-old man has held a fixed, non-bizarre belief for 8 months that his wife is unfaithful, despite no evidence. He has no hallucinations, no disorganized speech, and continues to work and function normally apart from this belief. The most likely diagnosis is:",
   "options": [
