   "topic": "Schizophrenia & psychosis",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "After several years of typical antipsychotic treatment, a patient develops persistent involuntary lip-smacking, tongue protrusion, and chewing movements. Which statement about this condition is CORRECT?",
