   "topic": "Schizophrenia & psychosis",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "A 26-year-old woman develops amenorrhoea and galactorrhoea after starting an antipsychotic. Which of the following agents is MOST likely to have caused this via tuberoinfundibular D2 blockade and elevated prolactin?",
