   "topic": "Schizophrenia & psychosis",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "A patient with treatment-resistant schizophrenia is being started on clozapine. Which monitoring requirement is MANDATORY specifically because of clozapine's most feared haematological adverse effect?",
