   "subject": "Radiology",
   "topic": "Radiation safety & principles",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "The becquerel (Bq) is the SI unit of radioactivity (one disintegration per second). One curie (Ci) is equal to:",
