   "stem": "Assertion (A): Follicular carcinoma of the thyroid cannot be diagnosed by fine-needle aspiration cytology (FNAC) alone. Reason (R): The distinction between a follicular adenoma and a follicular carcinoma rests on capsular and/or vascular invasion, which can only be demonstrated on histology of the whole capsule.",
