   "stem": "A patient with a past history of heart disease presents with central chest pain. The ECG shows ST-segment elevation in the anterior leads (V2-V4) and lateral leads (I, aVL, V5, V6), with reciprocal ST depression in the inferior leads (III, aVF). What is the diagnosis?",
