   "subject": "Anaesthesia",
   "topic": "Preop assessment (ASA), airway management",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "A known hyperthyroid patient not on medication is scheduled for total thyroidectomy, and the pre-anaesthetic check was not done properly. What is the leading complication that can occur during surgery?",
   "options": [
