   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "A patient develops oliguric renal failure after a crush injury. Urinary sodium is 45 mEq/L, the fractional excretion of sodium is 3 percent and urine osmolality is 300 mOsm/kg. What is the diagnosis?",
