   "topic": "Trauma, shock, ATLS basics",
   "part": "B",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "In the ICU there is a failed attempt at subclavian vein catheterization, and shortly afterwards the BP drops and the pulse rises. What is the diagnosis?",
   "options": [
