   "stem": "A newborn presents with conjugated hyperbilirubinemia, intrahepatic cholestasis, high alkaline phosphatase and eosinophilic PAS-positive cytoplasmic granules on liver biopsy (suggestive of alpha-1-antitrypsin deficiency). What is the most common cause of jaundice in this setting?",
