   "stem": "A 24-year-old woman presents with facial puffiness, pedal edema, hypertension, frothy urine, photosensitivity, oral ulcers, and joint pain. Investigations show positive ANA, anti-dsDNA antibodies, low serum C3 and C4 levels, and proteinuria of 4.2 g/day. What is the primary mechanism of renal damage in this patient?",
