   "stem": "An unfasted patient with acute bowel obstruction needs emergency general anaesthesia. To minimise the risk of regurgitation and pulmonary aspiration during induction, the anaesthetist plans a rapid sequence induction. Which combination of steps is characteristic of this technique?",
   "options": [
