    "In the medulla",
    "In the spinal cord",
    "In the peripheral nerves"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Decorticate rigidity indicates a lesion above the midbrain with release of the rubrospinal tract, and carries a better prognosis than decerebrate extensor posturing, which implies brainstem involvement at or below the midbrain.",
