    "Incision and suction of the bite",
    "Tourniquet application",
    "Polyvalent anti-snake venom"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "A prolonged 20-minute whole blood clotting test indicates systemic envenomation by a viper and mandates polyvalent antivenom. Tourniquets and incision are harmful and are no longer recommended.",
