    "Statins",
    "Inhaled bronchodilators",
    "Proton pump inhibitors",
    "Long-acting benzodiazepines and anticholinergics"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "The Beers criteria flag long-acting benzodiazepines, anticholinergics, first-generation antihistamines and typical antipsychotics as potentially inappropriate in older adults because of sedation, falls, delirium and urinary retention.",
