   "topic": "Medical disorders in pregnancy: anaemia, diabetes, heart disease",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "Screening for gestational diabetes with the DIPSI single-step 75 g oral glucose test is positive when the 2-hour value is:",
   "options": [
    "140 mg/dL or more",
    "200 mg/dL or more",
    "120 mg/dL or more",
    "100 mg/dL or more"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "The Indian DIPSI approach gives 75 g glucose irrespective of fasting status and diagnoses gestational diabetes at a 2-hour value of 140 mg/dL or above, chosen for feasibility in community settings.",
   "reference": "Government of India GDM Guidelines",
   "tags": [
