   "concept": "Congenital varicella syndrome - limb hypoplasia, cicatricial skin scarring, chorioretinitis and cortical atrophy - is greatest between 8 and 20 weeks. Maternal infection within 5 days before to 2 days after delivery risks severe neonatal varicella and needs VZIG.",
