    "Causes fulminant hepatic failure with mortality up to 20 percent in the third trimester",
    "Causes chronic hepatitis",
    "Is prevented by immunoglobulin"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "Hepatitis E has a markedly increased case fatality in the third trimester with fulminant hepatic failure, obstetric haemorrhage and high fetal loss. Prevention is through safe drinking water as no vaccine is widely available in India.",
