    "Gestational diabetes",
    "No adverse outcome",
    "Polyhydramnios"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Up to 30% of untreated asymptomatic bacteriuria progresses to acute pyelonephritis in pregnancy with preterm labour and low birth weight, so all pregnant women are screened by urine culture and treated.",
