   "stem": "The commonest cause of polyhydramnios is:",
   "options": [
    "Maternal diabetes",
    "Anencephaly",
    "Oesophageal atresia",
    "Idiopathic"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "About 60% of polyhydramnios is idiopathic. Identifiable causes include maternal diabetes, fetal anomalies impairing swallowing such as anencephaly and oesophageal atresia, twin-to-twin transfusion and fetal hydrops.",
   "reference": "DC Dutta's Textbook of Obstetrics 9e, Ch. Polyhydramnios",
   "tags": [
