   "source": "ai",
   "verified": "Y",
   "verified_by": "model-audit",
   "topic": "Third-stage complications, retained placenta & uterine inversion",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "The uterotonic of first choice for prophylaxis of postpartum haemorrhage is:",
   "options": [
    "Methylergometrine in a hypertensive woman",
    "Misoprostol always",
    "Carboprost",
    "Oxytocin 10 units intramuscular"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Oxytocin is first choice for both prevention and treatment because of its rapid onset and favourable safety profile. Ergometrine is contraindicated in hypertension and cardiac disease, and carboprost in asthma.",
   "reference": "KD Tripathi Essentials of Medical Pharmacology 8e, Ch. Oxytocics",
   "tags": [
