   "verified": "Y",
   "verified_by": "model-audit",
   "topic": "Infertility & assisted reproduction",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "Under the Indian ART and Surrogacy legislation, commercial surrogacy is:",
   "options": [
    "Unregulated",
    "Prohibited, with only altruistic surrogacy permitted for eligible couples",
    "Freely permitted",
    "Permitted for foreign nationals"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "The Surrogacy (Regulation) Act 2021 and the ART (Regulation) Act 2021 prohibit commercial surrogacy, allowing only altruistic surrogacy by a close relative for eligible Indian couples, and mandate registration of ART clinics and banks.",
