   "topic": "Endometriosis, adenomyosis & chronic pelvic pain",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "The definitive treatment of adenomyosis in a woman who has completed her family is:",
   "options": [
    "Uterine artery embolisation",
    "Hysterectomy",
    "Endometrial ablation",
    "Myomectomy"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "Because the lesion is diffusely within the myometrium, hysterectomy is definitive. The levonorgestrel intrauterine system, GnRH analogues and uterine artery embolisation are uterus-conserving options for younger women.",
