    "Hysterectomy",
    "Immediate sling surgery",
    "Indwelling catheter"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Behavioural bladder retraining with fluid and caffeine modification, plus an antimuscarinic such as solifenacin or the beta-3 agonist mirabegron, is first line. Intravesical botulinum toxin is reserved for refractory cases.",
