   "topic": "Menopause, HRT & osteoporosis",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "The most effective treatment for troublesome vasomotor symptoms of menopause is:",
   "options": [
    "Bisphosphonates",
    "Systemic oestrogen therapy, with a progestogen if the uterus is present",
    "Calcium supplements",
    "Vaginal lubricants"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "Systemic oestrogen is the most effective treatment for hot flushes and night sweats. A progestogen must be added in a woman with a uterus to prevent endometrial hyperplasia and carcinoma from unopposed oestrogen.",
