    "Minus 1.0 or lower"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "WHO defines osteopenia as a T-score between minus 1 and minus 2.5 and osteoporosis as minus 2.5 or below on DEXA at the hip or lumbar spine. A fragility fracture establishes clinical osteoporosis irrespective of the score.",
