    "An agonist on bone with antagonist action on breast and endometrium",
    "A progesterone agonist"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Raloxifene preserves bone density and reduces vertebral fracture and breast cancer risk while not stimulating the endometrium, but it worsens hot flushes and increases thromboembolic risk.",
