   "stem": "A complete hydatidiform mole has which karyotype?",
   "options": [
    "46,XY of maternal origin",
    "45,XO",
    "69,XXY triploid",
    "46,XX entirely of paternal origin (diploid androgenetic)"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "A complete mole arises from fertilisation of an empty ovum, giving a diploid androgenetic 46,XX karyotype with no fetal tissue, diffuse villous swelling and marked trophoblastic proliferation. A partial mole is triploid, usually 69,XXY, with fetal parts.",
