    "At the posterolateral vaginal introitus at 4 and 8 o'clock",
    "At the anterior vestibule",
    "In the labia majora tip"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "The greater vestibular glands open into the posterolateral introitus; duct obstruction gives a cyst and infection an abscess. Marsupialisation is preferred over simple incision as it reduces recurrence; excision is needed in women over 40 to exclude carcinoma.",
