    "100 mL/kg over 1 hour",
    "30 mL/kg over 30 minutes then 70 mL/kg over 2.5 hours",
    "20 mL/kg over 20 minutes"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "For infants under 12 months the first 30 mL/kg is given over 1 hour and the next 70 mL/kg over 5 hours; for children above 12 months the same volumes are given over 30 minutes and 2.5 hours respectively.",
