    "Lethargy or unconsciousness, sunken eyes, inability to drink and very slow skin pinch",
    "Restlessness only",
    "Normal skin pinch"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "Two or more of lethargy or unconsciousness, sunken eyes, inability to drink or drinking poorly, and a skin pinch returning very slowly classify severe dehydration requiring Plan C intravenous therapy.",
