    "Generalised tonic-clonic activity",
    "Absence spells",
    "Myoclonic jerks only"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Neonatal cortical immaturity means seizures are often subtle - ocular deviation, oro-buccal movements, pedalling, apnoea or autonomic change - so amplitude-integrated EEG is valuable, and generalised tonic-clonic seizures essentially do not occur.",
