   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "Galactose-1-phosphate uridyltransferase deficiency causes vomiting, jaundice, hepatomegaly, cataract and a predisposition to E. coli sepsis once lactose-containing milk is started. A lactose-free diet is life-saving.",
