    "Short stature, webbed neck, streak ovaries and 45,XO karyotype"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Turner syndrome shows short stature, webbed neck, wide-spaced nipples, cubitus valgus, coarctation or bicuspid aortic valve, horseshoe kidney and primary amenorrhoea with high FSH. Growth hormone and oestrogen replacement are used.",
