   "concept": "Persistent generalised lymphadenopathy with bilateral parotid swelling, hepatosplenomegaly, oral thrush, chronic diarrhoea and failure to thrive is a classic paediatric HIV presentation, and parotid enlargement is particularly suggestive.",
