    "Urinary tract infection by Proteus",
    "Osteomyelitis",
    "Tuberculous meningitis"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Loss of immunoglobulins and complement factor B in urine impairs opsonisation of encapsulated organisms, so pneumococcal peritonitis is characteristic; pneumococcal and varicella vaccination are recommended in remission.",
