    "Congenital cataract only",
    "Vitamin A deficiency"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "A white pupillary reflex with squint is the classic presentation of retinoblastoma, which may be hereditary and bilateral from RB1 germline mutation. Delay risks extraocular spread and death, so urgent examination under anaesthesia is required.",
