   "concept": "21-hydroxylase deficiency, the commonest form, shunts precursors to androgens causing ambiguous genitalia in females and salt-wasting crisis with hyponatraemia, hyperkalaemia and hypotension. Treatment is hydrocortisone with fludrocortisone.",
