   "concept": "Tourette syndrome requires multiple motor and at least one vocal tic for more than a year with onset before 18 years, often with obsessive-compulsive symptoms and ADHD. Behavioural therapy is first line, with risperidone or clonidine if severe.",
   "reference": "Nelson Textbook of Pediatrics 21e, Ch. Tic Disorders",
   "tags": [
    "#high-yield"
   ],
   "verified_on": "2026-09-01"
  },
  {
   "id": "Q_PED_BEH_009",
