   "stem": "The tensile strength of a healing wound at the end of one week is approximately what percentage of final strength?",
   "options": [
    "Eighty percent",
    "Fifty percent",
    "Ten percent",
    "Ninety-five percent"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Wound strength is only about 10% at one week, rising to 30% at three weeks and plateauing at 70 to 80% of original strength by three months - collagen remodelling continues but never restores full strength.",
