   "topic": "Burns & basics of plastic surgery",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "Marjolin ulcer is:",
   "options": [
    "A pressure sore",
    "A basal cell carcinoma of the face",
    "A venous ulcer",
    "A squamous cell carcinoma arising in a chronic burn scar or long-standing sinus"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Malignant transformation in a chronic unstable scar, ulcer or sinus produces a well-differentiated but locally aggressive squamous carcinoma after many years. Any non-healing or changing scar should be biopsied.",
