   "topic": "Liver, spleen & portal hypertension surgery",
   "difficulty": "E",
   "stem": "The Child-Pugh score assesses all EXCEPT:",
   "options": [
    "Ascites and encephalopathy",
    "Serum bilirubin",
    "Serum albumin",
    "Serum creatinine"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Child-Pugh uses bilirubin, albumin, prothrombin time or INR, ascites and encephalopathy. Creatinine features in the MELD score, which also uses bilirubin and INR and is used for transplant prioritisation.",
