   "concept": "Autoimmune destruction with anti-TPO and anti-thyroglobulin antibodies produces dense lymphoplasmacytic infiltration with germinal centres and oxyphilic Hurthle cells. It carries an increased risk of thyroid MALT lymphoma.",
