    "A collection of red cells",
    "A focal collection of activated epithelioid macrophages, often with multinucleate giant cells",
    "A fibrous scar"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Granulomas form when macrophages cannot eliminate an agent, transforming into epithelioid cells with abundant pink cytoplasm surrounded by lymphocytes. Th1 cytokines, especially interferon gamma and TNF, drive and maintain them.",
