   "stem": "Hyperacute rejection of a transplanted kidney occurs:",
   "options": [
    "After weeks",
    "After years",
    "Within minutes to hours, due to preformed recipient antibodies against donor antigens",
    "Only with living donors"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Preformed anti-donor antibodies from prior transfusion, pregnancy or transplantation bind graft endothelium, activating complement and causing thrombosis with immediate graft failure. Crossmatching before transplantation prevents it.",
