    "Is entirely benign"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Atypical hyperplasia (endometrioid intraepithelial neoplasia) progresses to carcinoma in a large proportion and often coexists with it. Unopposed oestrogen from obesity, anovulation, tamoxifen or oestrogen-only therapy is the usual driver.",
