   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Epithelial tumours account for about 90% of ovarian malignancy, with high-grade serous carcinoma the commonest, often showing psammoma bodies, TP53 mutation and origin from the fallopian tube fimbria. CA-125 is used for monitoring.",
