    "The course of disease from onset to resolution in the absence of intervention",
    "Only the incubation period",
    "Only the fatal outcome"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "Understanding pre-pathogenesis and pathogenesis phases identifies the points where each level of prevention can be applied, and provides the baseline against which the effect of treatment is judged.",
