   "topic": "Vector-borne disease: dengue, chikungunya, filaria, kala-azar",
   "difficulty": "E",
   "stem": "The vector of dengue is:",
   "options": [
    "Aedes aegypti, a daytime biter breeding in clean stagnant water",
    "Culex quinquefasciatus",
    "Phlebotomus argentipes",
    "Anopheles culicifacies"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Aedes aegypti is a domestic daytime biter with a limited flight range, breeding in clean water in household containers, so source reduction and personal protection during the day are the mainstays of control.",
   "reference": "Park's Textbook of Preventive and Social Medicine 27e, Ch. Dengue",
   "tags": [
