   "topic": "Bacterial structure, growth, genetics & antimicrobial resistance",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "Bacterial endotoxin differs from exotoxin in that it is:",
   "options": [
    "Converted to toxoid",
    "Protein and heat labile",
    "Highly immunogenic",
    "Lipopolysaccharide, heat stable, poorly immunogenic and cannot be toxoided"
   ],
