   "topic": "Herpesviruses, CMV & EBV",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "Epstein-Barr virus is aetiologically linked to all EXCEPT:",
   "options": [
    "Burkitt lymphoma",
    "Nasopharyngeal carcinoma",
    "Post-transplant lymphoproliferative disease",
    "Kaposi sarcoma"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "EBV is associated with Burkitt and Hodgkin lymphoma, nasopharyngeal carcinoma and post-transplant lymphoproliferative disorder. Kaposi sarcoma is caused by human herpesvirus 8.",
