   "stem": "The commonest cause of congenital infection worldwide is:",
   "options": [
    "Toxoplasma",
    "Rubella",
    "Herpes simplex",
    "Cytomegalovirus"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Congenital CMV affects 0.5 to 1% of live births and is the leading infectious cause of sensorineural deafness and neurodevelopmental disability, though most infected newborns are asymptomatic at birth.",
