   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "The drug of choice for cytomegalovirus retinitis in AIDS is:",
   "options": [
    "Acyclovir",
    "Ganciclovir or valganciclovir",
    "Zidovudine",
    "Amantadine"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "CMV thymidine kinase differs from that of HSV, so acyclovir is ineffective; ganciclovir, valganciclovir, foscarnet and cidofovir are used. Bone marrow suppression limits ganciclovir and nephrotoxicity limits foscarnet.",
