   "topic": "Muscle relaxants, monitoring, anaesthesia machine & breathing circuits",
   "difficulty": "H",
   "stem": "The Bain circuit is a modification of which Mapleson system?",
   "options": [
    "Mapleson C",
    "Mapleson D",
    "Mapleson A",
    "Mapleson F"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "The Bain is a coaxial Mapleson D, efficient for controlled ventilation. Mapleson A (Magill) is most efficient for spontaneous ventilation, and Jackson-Rees (Mapleson F) is used in children.",
