    "Corneal oedema",
    "Progressive corneal thinning and conical protrusion with irregular astigmatism",
    "Corneal flattening"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Keratoconus presents in adolescence with progressive myopic astigmatism, Munson sign, Fleischer ring and Vogt striae. Rigid contact lenses, corneal collagen cross-linking to halt progression and keratoplasty are the treatment options.",
