    "Avascular, conferring immune privilege",
    "Non-innervated"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Avascularity and absent lymphatics limit antigen presentation, giving immune privilege. Vascularisation from previous inflammation is the main risk factor for graft rejection, indicated by the Khodadoust line.",
