    "Worsen herpetic and fungal keratitis, raise intraocular pressure and cause cataract",
    "Prevent infection",
    "Cure all keratitis"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "Steroid use without slit-lamp examination and fluorescein staining risks corneal melt, perforation and blindness, in addition to steroid-induced glaucoma and posterior subcapsular cataract with prolonged use.",
