   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Timing guides aetiology: chemical within 1 to 2 days, gonococcal at 2 to 5 days with hyperacute purulent discharge threatening corneal perforation, and chlamydial at 5 to 14 days. Gonococcal disease is a medical emergency.",
