   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Persistent inflammation causes complicated cataract, secondary glaucoma from synechiae, band keratopathy from calcium deposition and cyclitic membrane with hypotony. Pterygium is caused by ultraviolet exposure and is unrelated.",
