    "Squint alone",
    "Conjunctivitis",
    "Refractive error"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "A white pupillary reflex, often with squint, is the commonest presentation of retinoblastoma, a life-threatening malignancy. Other causes include congenital cataract, Coats disease and persistent fetal vasculature.",
