   "topic": "Retina & vitreous: vascular occlusions, ARMD, retinoblastoma",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "Hereditary retinoblastoma is characterised by:",
   "options": [
    "No genetic basis",
    "No risk of other tumours",
    "Unilateral disease only",
    "Bilateral multifocal tumours with germline RB1 mutation and risk of second malignancies"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Germline RB1 mutation follows Knudson's two-hit model, causing earlier bilateral multifocal disease with a lifetime risk of osteosarcoma and other second cancers, so siblings and offspring require screening.",
