    "Corneal ulcer only",
    "No effect",
    "Immediate blindness only",
    "Siderosis bulbi with rusty deposits, cataract and retinal degeneration"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Iron dissociates causing siderosis with heterochromia, pupillary mydriasis, cataract and pigmentary retinopathy; copper causes chalcosis with a sunflower cataract and Kayser-Fleischer-like ring. Both need removal.",
