   "stem": "A fracture of the neck of femur classically presents with the limb:",
   "options": [
    "Lengthened",
    "Neutral",
    "Shortened and internally rotated",
    "Shortened and externally rotated"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "External rotation distinguishes it from posterior hip dislocation which is internally rotated. Intracapsular fractures risk avascular necrosis and non-union because the retinacular blood supply is disrupted.",
