    "Hypertension"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Steroids and alcohol account for most atraumatic cases; others include sickle cell disease, caisson disease, SLE and Gaucher disease. Early MRI detects marrow changes long before the radiographic crescent sign.",
