    "Blistered and red",
    "Firm, pale, depressed lesions with raised margins and no vital reaction of inflammation",
    "Deeply charred"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "The endogenous heat generated at the contact point produces a nodular pale crater with peripheral areola. Metallisation of the skin from the conductor may be demonstrated chemically and helps identify the object.",
