   "topic": "Thermal, electrical & lightning injuries; burns",
   "difficulty": "E",
   "stem": "Filigree (arborescent) burns are pathognomonic of:",
   "options": [
    "Electrocution from mains",
    "Lightning strike",
    "Scalds",
    "Flame burns"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "Lichtenberg or fern-like figures are transient superficial ferning patterns produced by electron showers tracking along the skin. They fade within hours, so early photography is essential, and they are diagnostic of lightning strike.",
