    "Blocking fertilisation only",
    "Preventing implantation only",
    "Killing sperm"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Negative feedback on gonadotrophin release prevents ovulation, with secondary effects of thickened cervical mucus and an unfavourable endometrium. Failure rate is under 1% with perfect use.",
