    "Acne",
    "A woman over 35 who smokes heavily, or with a history of thromboembolism",
    "Diabetes"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "The oestrogen component increases thrombotic risk, compounded by smoking after 35, migraine with aura, known thrombophilia and oestrogen-dependent tumours. Progestogen-only methods are safer alternatives.",
