    "As soon as possible and within 72 hours of unprotected intercourse",
    "After one week",
    "Only before intercourse"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "Efficacy declines with delay. Ulipristal is effective up to 120 hours, and the copper intrauterine device inserted within 5 days is the most effective emergency method and provides ongoing contraception.",
