    "Is an oxytocic",
    "Is an oestrogen",
    "Blocks LH",
    "Antagonises progesterone receptors, sensitising the myometrium to prostaglandins"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Mifepristone followed 24 to 48 hours later by misoprostol achieves complete abortion in over 95% of early pregnancies, and is permitted under the MTP Act up to 9 weeks by a registered practitioner.",
   "reference": "KD Tripathi Essentials of Medical Pharmacology 8e, Ch. Sex Hormones",
   "tags": [
