   "verified": "Y",
   "verified_by": "model-audit",
   "topic": "Sex hormones, contraceptives, uterine & bone drugs",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "Tamoxifen acts as a selective oestrogen receptor modulator that is:",
