    "Blocks dopamine",
    "Is an anticholinesterase",
    "Is a MAO inhibitor"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Amantadine gives modest symptomatic benefit and is particularly valued for reducing levodopa-induced dyskinesia. It causes livedo reticularis and ankle oedema, and was originally an antiviral against influenza A.",
