    "Inhibiting folate"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "These channels are absent in mammals and ivermectin poorly crosses the intact blood-brain barrier, giving selective toxicity. It is the drug of choice for strongyloidiasis, onchocerciasis and crusted scabies.",
