    "Stopping all treatment",
    "Thalidomide, or corticosteroids where thalidomide is contraindicated",
    "Antihistamines alone"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Thalidomide is dramatically effective but absolutely contraindicated in women of childbearing potential because of phocomelia. Multidrug therapy is continued throughout the reaction.",
