    "Blocking TNF",
    "Blocking purine synthesis",
    "Alkylating DNA"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Ciclosporin binds cyclophilin and tacrolimus binds FKBP, both inhibiting calcineurin. Nephrotoxicity is dose-limiting and requires trough level monitoring; gum hypertrophy and hirsutism are characteristic of ciclosporin.",
