    "Increasing the dose"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Folinic acid bypasses the blocked dihydrofolate reductase step rescuing normal cells. A catastrophic error is daily instead of weekly dosing in rheumatoid arthritis, causing fatal mucositis and marrow aplasia.",
