    "Safety, tolerability and pharmacokinetics, usually in healthy volunteers",
    "Post-marketing safety"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Phase I involves 20 to 100 subjects; phase II assesses efficacy and dose-finding in a few hundred patients; phase III confirms efficacy in large randomised trials; and phase IV is post-marketing surveillance.",
