    "Has sarcomeres",
    "Can maintain tension with low energy expenditure through the latch mechanism",
    "Cannot sustain tone",
    "Fatigues rapidly"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "The latch state allows sustained tone in vessels, gut and airways at minimal metabolic cost. Smooth muscle also lacks troponin and has no striations, using the calmodulin pathway instead.",
   "reference": "Ganong's Review of Medical Physiology 26e, Ch. Muscle Physiology",
