   "topic": "Blood: haemopoiesis, haemostasis, blood groups",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "Thrombin has which of the following actions?",
   "options": [
    "Inhibits platelets",
    "Converts fibrinogen to fibrin, activates factors V, VIII, XI and XIII and activates platelets",
    "Degrades fibrin",
    "Only cleaves fibrinogen"
