    "Thiourea drugs",
    "Iodide excess",
    "Thiocyanate and perchlorate",
    "Propranolol"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Carbimazole and propylthiouracil instead inhibit thyroid peroxidase, blocking organification and coupling. High-dose iodide acutely inhibits release - the Wolff-Chaikoff effect used before thyroid surgery.",
