    "Both prolactin for milk secretion and oxytocin for milk ejection",
    "Only oxytocin"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "The neuroendocrine reflex requires an intact hypothalamic pathway. Oxytocin release is conditionable and inhibited by pain and anxiety, whereas prolactin release is not - which is why maternal distress impairs let-down.",
