    "Constitutive expression",
    "Eukaryotic regulation"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "Lactose induces by inactivating the repressor, whereas the trp operon is repressible, being switched off when tryptophan is abundant. Both illustrate feedback economy in prokaryotes.",
