    "The reciprocal of the absolute risk reduction",
    "The odds ratio"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "A smaller NNT indicates greater benefit. It is more clinically meaningful than relative risk reduction, which can appear impressive even when the absolute benefit is trivial.",
