    "Communicable disease",
    "Maternal causes",
    "Injuries",
    "Cardiovascular disease"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "India has undergone epidemiological transition, with non-communicable diseases now accounting for about 60% of deaths, though a double burden persists as communicable disease remains significant.",
