   "concept": "It is a placement rather than a rejection exercise, and the baseline is essential for later attributing any change to occupational exposure in medico-legal and compensation proceedings.",
   "reference": "Park's Textbook of Preventive and Social Medicine 27e, Ch. Occupational Health",
