    "Staphylococcus",
    "Pseudomonas",
    "Clostridium tetani",
    "Escherichia coli"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "E. coli is chosen because it is always present in faeces, survives slightly longer than most pathogens and is easily detected. Any coliform in treated piped water indicates unsatisfactory quality.",
