    "2014, after three years with no wild poliovirus case",
    "2000",
    "2020",
    "2005"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "The last wild case was in West Bengal in January 2011. Surveillance continues through acute flaccid paralysis reporting in all children under 15 and environmental sewage sampling.",
