    "A funding bank",
    "A charity",
    "A research institute",
    "A specialised agency of the United Nations directing international health work"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Established in 1948 with headquarters in Geneva and six regional offices, India belongs to the South-East Asia Region with its office in New Delhi. The World Health Assembly is its governing body.",
   "reference": "Park's Textbook of Preventive and Social Medicine 27e, Ch. International Health",
   "tags": [
