    "Alport syndrome",
    "Thin basement membrane nephropathy",
    "Nail-patella syndrome"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "X-linked mutations in the alpha-5 chain of type IV collagen affect the cochlea, lens and glomerular basement membrane, which shows lamellated splitting on electron microscopy.",
   "reference": "Harrison's Principles of Internal Medicine 21e, Ch. 314 (Glomerular Diseases)",
