    "Delivery of the posterior arm",
    "Suprapubic pressure",
    "Fundal pressure"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Fundal pressure drives the anterior shoulder harder against the symphysis and increases the risk of uterine rupture and brachial plexus injury; suprapubic pressure directed obliquely is the correct adjunct.",
