   "topic": "Abortion, ectopic pregnancy, recurrent pregnancy loss",
   "difficulty": "E",
   "stem": "A woman at 9 weeks has vaginal bleeding with a closed cervical os, and ultrasound shows a live fetus of appropriate size. The diagnosis is:",
