    "Complete abortion",
    "Inevitable abortion",
    "Missed abortion",
    "Threatened abortion"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Bleeding with a closed os and a viable intrauterine pregnancy defines threatened abortion, and about two-thirds continue to term with expectant management.",
   "reference": "DC Dutta's Textbook of Obstetrics 9e, Ch. Abortion and Ectopic Pregnancy",
   "verified_on": "2026-09-01"
  },
  {
   "id": "Q_OBG_AEP_002",
