    "Repeat ultrasound in 6 months",
    "Laparoscopic cystectomy",
    "Referral to a gynaecological oncology centre for staging laparotomy",
    "Aspiration of the cyst under ultrasound"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "A high risk of malignancy index warrants primary surgery by a subspecialist because complete staging and optimal debulking determine survival, and cyst aspiration risks spilling malignant cells.",
   "reference": "Shaw's Textbook of Gynaecology 17e, Ch. Genital Malignancies",
   "verified_on": "2026-09-01"
