    "No assessment is needed",
    "Endometrial sampling, because oestrogen secretion causes hyperplasia or carcinoma",
    "Screening for a germline BRCA mutation"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "Granulosa cell tumours secrete oestrogen and inhibin, so up to a quarter have coexisting endometrial hyperplasia or carcinoma, and inhibin is used for long-term surveillance given the risk of very late recurrence.",
