    "Wilson disease",
    "Copper allergy",
    "Desire for immediate return of fertility after removal"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "The system reduces menstrual blood loss by up to 90 percent and is licensed for menorrhagia and endometrial protection, so it addresses two problems at once.",
   "reference": "Shaw's Textbook of Gynaecology 17e, Ch. Contraception",
