    "About 400 mOsm per litre",
    "About 245 mOsm per litre with 75 mmol sodium and 75 mmol glucose"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "The lower osmolarity reduces stool output, vomiting and the need for unscheduled intravenous fluid compared with the older formulation, without increasing hyponatraemia.",
