    "Give all due vaccines simultaneously at separate sites and complete the schedule without restarting",
    "Defer until the child is 1 year old"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "There is no maximum interval between doses, so a lapsed schedule is resumed rather than restarted, and simultaneous administration at separate sites is safe and improves coverage.",
