    "Toxoid alone",
    "Toxoid plus immunoglobulin",
    "Immunoglobulin alone"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Fully immunised children need no additional dose for a clean minor wound, whereas a dirty or deep wound needs a booster if the last dose was over 5 years ago.",
