    "Head-box oxygen alone",
    "High-frequency oscillatory ventilation as the initial mode"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Continuous distending pressure recruits alveoli and reduces the need for intubation and its ventilator-associated lung injury, which is why the less invasive route is preferred and surfactant is delivered by the INSURE or LISA technique when needed.",
