    "Vmax falls while Km is unchanged",
    "Both Vmax and Km rise",
    "Vmax rises while Km falls"
   ],
   "correct": 1,
   "concept": "The inhibitor binds a site distinct from the active site so substrate cannot outcompete it, whereas a competitive inhibitor raises the apparent Km and can be overcome by more substrate.",
