   "topic": "Anxiety disorders & substance use",
   "difficulty": "M",
   "stem": "A woman has become unable to leave home alone, use buses or enter crowded markets for fear of being unable to escape if she becomes unwell. What is the diagnosis?",
   "options": [
    "Specific phobia",
    "Social anxiety disorder",
    "Agoraphobia, frequently with panic attacks",
    "Generalised anxiety disorder"
   ],
   "correct": 2,
   "concept": "The core fear is of being trapped without escape or help rather than of the crowd itself, and graded exposure with an antidepressant is effective while avoidance maintains and worsens the disorder.",
