    "Increase the dose indefinitely",
    "Give flumazenil daily during the taper"
   ],
   "correct": 0,
   "concept": "Abrupt withdrawal risks seizures and a confusional state, and the antagonist is dangerous in dependence for the same reason, so the emphasis is on a gradual taper with psychological support.",
