    "A dissociative trance and possession disorder, diagnosed only when it is unwanted, distressing and outside accepted cultural or religious practice"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "concept": "Culturally accepted trance during religious ritual is not a disorder, so the diagnosis rests on distress, loss of control and impairment, and an organic cause including epilepsy must still be excluded.",
